{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:30:46.444Z","ordinal":16409,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0aa80-3aab-7313-9603-edf7533a1570","turn_id":"01a0b034-33c3-7cc0-b8f9-f6db910f9861","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_0b3476aa27839743016aac15ac7bd887d0afbdd6ec980a79bd","summary_text":[],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1789662636514,"completed_at_ms":1789662646444}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:30:46.447Z","ordinal":16410,"type":"response_item","payload":{"id":"rs_0b3476aa27839743016aac15ac7bd887d0afbdd6ec980a79bd","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b034-33c3-7cc0-b8f9-f6db910f9861"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:30:50.825Z","ordinal":16411,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0aa80-3aab-7313-9603-edf7533a1570","turn_id":"01a0b034-33c3-7cc0-b8f9-f6db910f9861","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0b3476aa27839743016aac15b66d6c87d0833442d15a7a88e9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Use a committed project configuration plus an explicit bootstrap command—not an automatic post-install hook.\n\n- Commit `.entire/settings.json` and `.entire/.gitignore` as the shared contract.\n- Keep generated agent adapters (`.codex/hooks.json`, `.claude/skills/...`, `.gemini/...`, `.opencode/...`) untracked.\n- Add an explicit, idempotent `just entire-enable` command that runs `entire enable --force`, then verifies `entire status --detailed`.\n- Optionally add a `just entire-check` command that reports drift, but don’t make CI mutate developer configs.\n\nI would not use a post-install hook: it silently rewrites tool-specific files, creates noisy diffs on CLI upgrades, and makes ordinary dependency setup mutate agent configuration. An explicit command makes upgrades intentional and reviewable.\n\nThat matches Entire’s own boundary: commit shared `.entire/settings.json` and `.entire/.gitignore`; keep local runtime state out of Git. Its agent hooks live in agent-specific folders, so treating them as generated outputs is the cleanest model. [Entire generated-file guidance](https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/entire-files) [Entire settings layers](https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/settings-layers)\n\nI recommend we add that small setup contract next, then ignore the currently generated adapter folders."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789662646448,"completed_at_ms":1789662650825}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:30:50.826Z","ordinal":16412,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0b3476aa27839743016aac15b66d6c87d0833442d15a7a88e9","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Use a committed project configuration plus an explicit bootstrap command—not an automatic post-install hook.\n\n- Commit `.entire/settings.json` and `.entire/.gitignore` as the shared contract.\n- Keep generated agent adapters (`.codex/hooks.json`, `.claude/skills/...`, `.gemini/...`, `.opencode/...`) untracked.\n- Add an explicit, idempotent `just entire-enable` command that runs `entire enable --force`, then verifies `entire status --detailed`.\n- Optionally add a `just entire-check` command that reports drift, but don’t make CI mutate developer configs.\n\nI would not use a post-install hook: it silently rewrites tool-specific files, creates noisy diffs on CLI upgrades, and makes ordinary dependency setup mutate agent configuration. An explicit command makes upgrades intentional and reviewable.\n\nThat matches Entire’s own boundary: commit shared `.entire/settings.json` and `.entire/.gitignore`; keep local runtime state out of Git. Its agent hooks live in agent-specific folders, so treating them as generated outputs is the cleanest model. [Entire generated-file guidance](https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/entire-files) [Entire settings layers](https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/settings-layers)\n\nI recommend we add that small setup contract next, then ignore the currently generated adapter folders."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b034-33c3-7cc0-b8f9-f6db910f9861","create_time":1789662635.351228,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
