{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:38:30.165Z","ordinal":16423,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0aa80-3aab-7313-9603-edf7533a1570","turn_id":"01a0b03b-cffa-7370-a0e4-4aab1956a308","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0b3476aa27839743016aac1783697c87d0bc6fb2f712e992be","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Partly.\n\nEntire explicitly recommends committing:\n\n- `.entire/settings.json` when Entire is a project feature\n- `.entire/.gitignore`\n- shared redaction rules, if any\n\nIt explicitly recommends keeping local settings, logs, temp files, metadata, and session pointers out of Git. [Entire’s generated-files guide](https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/entire-files)\n\nThe docs say agent hook files live in agent-specific folders, but do not explicitly say “commit” or “ignore” those generated adapters. My recommendation to generate them through an explicit `just entire-enable` command is an inference from their auto-generated markers and upgrade behavior—not a quoted Entire directive."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1789663107438,"completed_at_ms":1789663110165}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:38:30.167Z","ordinal":16424,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0b3476aa27839743016aac1783697c87d0bc6fb2f712e992be","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Partly.\n\nEntire explicitly recommends committing:\n\n- `.entire/settings.json` when Entire is a project feature\n- `.entire/.gitignore`\n- shared redaction rules, if any\n\nIt explicitly recommends keeping local settings, logs, temp files, metadata, and session pointers out of Git. [Entire’s generated-files guide](https://docs.entire.io/guides/configuration/entire-files)\n\nThe docs say agent hook files live in agent-specific folders, but do not explicitly say “commit” or “ignore” those generated adapters. My recommendation to generate them through an explicit `just entire-enable` command is an inference from their auto-generated markers and upgrade behavior—not a quoted Entire directive."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b03b-cffa-7370-a0e4-4aab1956a308","create_time":1789663106.050727,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}}}
