{"timestamp":"2026-09-17T16:56:58.163Z","ordinal":16570,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0b3476aa27839743016aac1bd33e2c87d0935c477315f09bc7","status":"completed","call_id":"call_jdlAEbE8IhrI7njldk16aXV1","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.entire/settings.json\\n@@\\n   \\\"checkpoints\\\": {\\n     \\\"primary\\\": {\\n       \\\"type\\\": \\\"git-refs\\\"\\n     }\\n+  },\\n+  \\\"strategy_options\\\": {\\n+    \\\"push_sessions\\\": false\\n   }\\n }\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.gitignore\\n@@\\n .claude/worktrees/\\n .playwright-mcp/\\n mutants.out/\\n+\\n+# Entire agent adapters are local generated integration files. The shared\\n+# Entire policy lives in .entire/settings.json and .entire/.gitignore.\\n+.agents/skills/entire-search/\\n+.claude/skills/entire-search/\\n+.codex/\\n+.gemini/skills/entire-search/\\n+.opencode/\\n*** Update File: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/CONTRIBUTING.md\\n@@\\n ### Local Initial Build\\n@@\\n just ci\\n ```\\n+\\n+### Optional Entire session capture\\n+\\n+Entire is an optional maintainer tool. The committed `.entire` configuration disables automatic\\n+checkpoint pushes because sessions can include prompts, responses, tool calls, and file changes.\\n+Do not push session data to this public repository by default.\\n+\\n+If you use Entire, install and authenticate its CLI locally, then run `entire status --detailed`.\\n+Use a separately approved private checkpoint remote before enabling session synchronization.\\n+Agent-specific integrations are local generated files and are not required to contribute.\\n*** End Patch\";\nconst r = await tools.apply_patch(patch);\ntext(typeof r === \"string\" ? r : JSON.stringify(r));","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b04c-4256-76d0-9985-a44bbf8963d1","create_time":1789664206.879139}}}
